---
description: Keep only cross-page reusable components in global components
alwaysApply: true
---

# Component Placement Rule

- Put page/feature-specific UI inside that feature route, e.g. `app/menu/_components` or `app/basket/_components`.
- Keep `components/` for components reused by multiple pages/routes.
- Before adding a new global component, verify it is used (or will be used) in at least two different pages.
- If a component becomes single-use after refactor, move it back to the owning feature folder.
- Shared providers and truly cross-page primitives can remain in `components/`.
